StandardFlatElevatedOutlinedBrand <p>Default card with soft shadow elevation.</p> <pre><code>VetraCard {
    Text("Card content")
}
</code></pre> <p>When to use: Default choice for most content grouping needs.</p> <p>No elevation or shadow, minimal visual weight.</p> <pre><code>VetraFlatCard {
    Text("Subtle grouping")
}
</code></pre> <p>When to use: Dense layouts, nested cards, or subtle grouping.</p> <p>Higher elevation for emphasis.</p> <pre><code>VetraElevatedCard {
    Text("Important content")
}
</code></pre> <p>When to use: Featured content, important information, floating elements.</p> <p>Border only, no shadow.</p> <pre><code>VetraOutlinedCard {
    Text("Bordered content")
}
</code></pre> <p>When to use: Light themes, minimalist designs, clear boundaries needed.</p> <p>Subtle brand color background.</p> <pre><code>VetraBrandCard {
    Text("Special content")
}
</code></pre> <p>When to use: Highlight special or promotional content.</p>

